usage: scribe2 pipe <intake|preflight|spawn|approve|answer|gate|land|retire|run|show|resume|stop|report|dispatch> [--state-dir D] [--repo R] [--rules PATH] [stop: --all|--run ID] [dispatch: (1 周)|ls|first|hold|release BEAD] [--runner CMD] [flags]
pipe: --run が要る
pipe: --all が要る
usage: scribe2 pipe <intake|preflight|spawn|approve|answer|gate|land|retire|run|show|resume|stop|report|dispatch> [--state-dir D] [--repo R] [--rules PATH] [stop: --all|--run ID] [dispatch: (1 周)|ls|first|hold|release BEAD] [--runner CMD] [flags]
pipe: 未知の引数 --no-review（審査の段を飛ばす口は無い）
